<section class="programHero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Charlotte &#xB7; North Carolina &#xB7; Bilingual guide</p>
    <h1>Programs that can change how much you need to buy.</h1>
    <p>Manuela helps her buyers identify, compare and organize questions about these paths. She represents the purchase; the participating lender and the program administrator verify documents, funds, eligibility and approval.</p>
    <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#compare">Compare programs</a>
